## Third-party notices

BoneStudio is a clean-room reimplementation. It does not contain, copy or
redistribute source code, bytecode, or runtime files of DragonBones Pro or the
Egret engine.

The read-only analysis that informed its format support is documented in
`docs/DBPRO-SPEC.md` and `docs/REVERSE-ENGINEERING.md`; those documents record
format facts and observed behaviour only, and no decompiled implementation is
included in this repository.

Bundled or depended-upon third-party packages keep their own licenses — see
`docs/OSS-REFERENCES.md` for the full list. Notably:

- DragonBones runtime format definitions — MIT (DragonBonesJS)
- PixiJS v8 — MIT
- React 18 — MIT
- Spine Runtimes (`@esotericsoftware/spine-core` 4.1 / 4.2) — Spine Runtimes License

Sample DragonBones project files shipped with DragonBones Pro are **not**
included in this repository.
